EXPLAIN
-> Gather: 4 workers, parallel scan on t4  (...)
    -> Nested loop inner join  (...)
        -> Sort: t2.fld3  (...)
            -> Table scan on t2  (...)
        -> Filter: (t2.fld1 = t4.t2nr)  (...)
            -> Parallel covering index lookup on t4 using t2nr (t2nr=t2.fld1)  (...)

